INSERT INTO hostlist_host_details (host_id,host_experience_years,team_size,motivation,specific_skills,offer_extra_info,business_impact) VALUES (214,13.3,38,'I want our team habits to be understandable to someone joining from another country or background. I want technical knowledge to travel across the whole team. We can reserve time to compare the first idea with what testing reveals. We keep the backlog flexible and choose a contribution together after an initial conversation.','PostgreSQL, access controls and integration tests; accessibility checks and secure session handling; reproducible analytics using de-identified records; privacy-aware data modelling and audit trails; clear technical notes.','The studio has recently started rebuilding a de-identified service analytics dashboard. We welcome someone who likes asking why a workflow behaves as it does. We are looking for someone who can improve an accessible interface using safe test data. The first milestone can lead to a tested feature that can be included in the next release. A senior teammate will help define a bounded task and give feedback at each milestone.','["A useful outcome would give safer handling of test data and technical changes.","A related benefit is a more approachable path for a new team member.","The team is exploring a de-identified service analytics dashboard, so the result can inform a practical next step."]');
