INSERT INTO hostlist_host_details (host_id,host_experience_years,team_size,motivation,specific_skills,offer_extra_info,business_impact) VALUES (216,12.1,36,'Sharing the reasoning behind my work is one of the most useful parts of collaborating. I want a learner to finish with a contribution they can confidently describe. We value a final handover that captures both the result and the learning. A practical outcome matters more than a polished presentation.','Python automation and threat modelling; Linux hardening and container scanning; detection rules and incident documentation; remediation tracking and security automation; clear technical notes.','A compact project crew is improving a secure onboarding path for a SaaS service. Someone who can explain their reasoning will find plenty to explore here. You would help the team add a security check to a development pipeline. The first milestone can lead to a maintainable contribution with tests and a short handover note. We use short demos and written notes so learning does not depend on being in one meeting.','["We want the work to improve safer handling of test data and technical changes.","A related benefit is a clearer view of where the workflow needs improvement.","The team is exploring a secure onboarding path for a SaaS service, so the result can inform a practical next step."]');
