INSERT INTO hostlist_host_details (host_id,host_experience_years,team_size,motivation,specific_skills,offer_extra_info,business_impact) VALUES (254,12.1,4,'We would like to exchange practical knowledge while building something that has a clear user. I enjoy explaining trade-offs using examples from the work at hand. We want the collaboration to leave behind something useful for both sides. Progress is discussed openly, with room to question assumptions and revise the approach.','TypeScript developer tools and release automation; Git, issue triage and reproducible builds; API documentation and newcomer-friendly examples; cross-platform testing and release automation; clear technical notes.','We are preparing the next version of a command-line helper for data cleanup. Someone who can explain their reasoning will find plenty to explore here. The initial task could focus on add a regression test for a reported edge case. The first milestone can lead to a tested feature that can be included in the next release. We use short demos and written notes so learning does not depend on being in one meeting.','["The expected benefit is faster discovery of issues while they are still easy to fix.","A related benefit is less repeated manual checking for the product team.","The team is exploring a command-line helper for data cleanup, so the result can inform a practical next step."]');
