INSERT INTO hostlist_host_details (host_id,host_experience_years,team_size,motivation,specific_skills,offer_extra_info,business_impact) VALUES (255,6.4,16,'I enjoy helping people connect technical choices to the needs behind a product. I want technical knowledge to travel across the whole team. A small retrospective helps us improve the experience for the next person. We prefer small changes that can be reviewed with the people who will use them.','dbt models and warehouse testing; Python, SQL and reproducible notebooks; pipeline monitoring and dataset provenance; privacy-aware data modelling and audit trails; clear technical notes.','A cross-functional group is maintaining a transparent demand-forecasting service. Curiosity and clear communication matter more than knowing every tool already. Depending on your interests, you might compare a baseline with a carefully measured alternative. The first milestone can lead to a tested feature that can be included in the next release. The first days focus on setup and context; after that we agree on a deliverable together.','["The expected benefit is more predictable releases with fewer last-minute surprises.","A related benefit is fewer confusing steps for first-time users.","The team is exploring a transparent demand-forecasting service, so the result can inform a practical next step."]');
