INSERT INTO hostlist_host_details (host_id,host_experience_years,team_size,motivation,specific_skills,offer_extra_info,business_impact) VALUES (422,8.4,14,'I like creating a calm space where a newcomer can ask precise questions and try an idea. I like making unfamiliar systems easier to navigate. We are happy to explain the context behind the work before choosing a task. A practical outcome matters more than a polished presentation.','Rust performance tools and cross-platform CI; JavaScript test runners and browser automation; editor integrations and API documentation; performance profiling for developer workflows; clear technical notes.','A cross-functional group is maintaining a test fixture generator for API clients. A learner with an interest in practical teamwork will have room to contribute. Depending on your interests, you might reduce a confusing diagnostic to a useful reproducible case. The first milestone can lead to an improvement that reduces avoidable manual work. A senior teammate will help define a bounded task and give feedback at each milestone.','["A useful outcome would give safer handling of test data and technical changes.","A related benefit is better access for people using assistive technology.","The team is exploring a test fixture generator for API clients, so the result can inform a practical next step."]');
